msgid ""
"Accepting the ``+`` and ``/`` characters with an alternative alphabet is now "
"deprecated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/base64.rst:132
msgid ""
"Encode :term:`bytes-like object` *s* using the standard Base64 alphabet and "
